msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Didn't think Mine was the kinda guy to slaughter one of his\r\n"
"own like that. Pretty fuckin' brutal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Wouldn't ya say, Kiryu-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Least Kanda's outta our hair. And Hamazaki's probably fish\r\n"
"bait by now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Meanin' it's all over. Everyone who was tryin' to rub you\r\n"
"and Daigo outta the picture is finished."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Well, not exactly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Hamazaki was a traitor, there's no question about that. And\r\n"
"thanks to the Snake Flower, he and his family are no more.\r\n"
"But that doesn't mean this is the end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"There's still that man who looks like Kazama. I doubt he\r\n"
"would have put a bullet in Daigo just for the hell of it...\r\n"
"meaning someone's probably giving him orders."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"That's the only explanation for him shooting Nakahara and\r\n"
"stealing the land deed, too. He can't be working alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Hamazaki's the most obvious suspect, since he was after\r\n"
"control of both the resort and the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"But if this Kazama guy was working for Hamazaki, why would\r\n"
"he go outta his way to save Kiryu and Rikiya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "There are still a ton of question marks here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Kiryu. I'm gonna try to find out what happened to Hamazaki. Florist, do me a"
" favor and look into Mine and the Hakuho Clan while I'm gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Mine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"At this point, Tojo leadership's been practically decimated.\r\n"
"Majima and Mine are the only two left standing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "You implyin' I got a horse in this race!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Heh. If I was, I sure wouldn't have said it to your face."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"All right. I'll see what I can dig up on the Hakuho and that\r\n"
"Kazama look-alike."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Speaking of Kazama-san... his family is leaderless now that\r\n"
"Kashiwagi-san is gone. Think you can step up in his place, Majima-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Oh, and be careful. I'm sure some of the other families\r\n"
"will try to take advantage of the power vacuum this creates."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "I, er... Sure. Ya got it, Kiryu-chan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Kiryu. Let me know the second you learn anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "I will."
msgstr "Certo."

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Well, all that's left to do now is put this plan into\r\n"
"action. We'll be in touch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Heh. Guess I got a date with the Kazama Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"(First things first, I've gotta make sure Rikiya gets back\r\n"
"to Okinawa. The least I can do is see him to a taxi.)"
msgstr ""

